              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ग़म — ġam — \"grief; sorrow at a loss\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पूरा परिवार दादा की मौत के ग़म में है। pūrā parivār dādā kī maut ke ġam meṁ hai. The whole family is grieving over my grandfather's death."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ग़म (ġam) is usually traced to Arabic ġamm, \"grief, distress\", which reached Hindi through Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
