          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कुढ़ना (kuṛhnā) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Hindi kuṛhnā, \"to be annoyed, to grieve\", under Sanskrit kruddhá, \"angry\" (CDIAL 3598). It is the anger or sorrow one swallows instead of showing."
